    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Inconsistent customer responses rarely surface as obvious failures. There’s no alert or dashboard metric that directly attributes churn to conflicting information across support channels. Instead, these breakdowns appear as isolated issues]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
